### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### SePay payment flow — IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Bấm nút ▶ (Run) bên trái từng request, theo THỨ TỰ 1 → 4.
### apiKey phải KHỚP với SEPAY_API_KEY trong .env
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084
@apiKey  = 2WJ8QVZG2XB1LH4KD03BPQWYPD4KUFOHIBMNA97YE1TRF5RINSLESUWZCGLXCGLN

### 1. Ping — kiểm tra service sống
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/ping

### 2. Tạo payment (PENDING) — server sinh transferCode + qrUrl
# > {% ... %} : bắt transferCode + id từ response, lưu vào biến global
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": 42,
  "userId": 7,
  "amount": 2500000,
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-key-001",
  "method": "BANK_TRANSFER"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("transferCode", response.body.transferCode);
    client.global.set("paymentId",   response.body.id);
    client.log("transferCode = " + response.body.transferCode);
    client.log("qrUrl        = " + response.body.qrUrl);
%}

### 3. Giả lập webhook SePay báo "tiền đã vào" (dùng transferCode vừa bắt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/webhooks/sepay
Authorization: Apikey {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 9216,
  "gateway": "MBBank",
  "transactionDate": "2026-06-01 17:00:00",
  "accountNumber": "2511112005",
  "code": "{{transferCode}}",
  "content": "CT tu 0987654321 {{transferCode}} chuyen tien",
  "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": 2500000,
  "referenceCode": "MBVCB.{{$randomInt}}"
}

> {%
    client.test("webhook 200 + success", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "status != 200");
        client.assert(response.body.success === true, "success != true");
    });
%}

### 4. Kiểm tra payment đã chuyển SUCCESS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}

> {%
    client.test("payment is SUCCESS", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.status === "SUCCESS",
            "status = " + response.body.status + " (chua SUCCESS)");
    });
%}

### ── CÁC CA LỖI (chạy lại để test) ──

### 5a. Sai số tiền → payment FAILED (tạo payment mới trước: đổi idempotencyKey ở #2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/webhooks/sepay
Authorization: Apikey {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gateway": "MBBank", "accountNumber": "2511112005",
  "code": "{{transferCode}}", "content": "CK {{transferCode}}",
  "transferType": "in", "transferAmount": 9999,
  "referenceCode": "MBVCB.WRONG{{$randomInt}}"
}

### 5b. Sai API key → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/webhooks/sepay
Authorization: Apikey sai-key-hoan-toan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{transferCode}}", "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": 2500000, "referenceCode": "X1"
}

### 5c. transferCode không tồn tại → ignored (success:true, applied:false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/webhooks/sepay
Authorization: Apikey {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "ABS999KHONGCO", "transferType": "in",
  "transferAmount": 2500000, "referenceCode": "Y1"
}
